  "trials": 3,
  "proof_scope": "Claim-based and seam-based checks for Graham\u2019s OpenAI interview skill chain: public OpenAI/privacy context grounding, Memory-native recall/persistence, bounded Hack SAST receipts, Terraform handoff, React qid surface, and hot-reload demo loop, Swagger Lucide source-sync controls, and the live endpoint playground.",
