    "proves": "Graham can compose skills into a working OpenAI-relevant evidence loop: Memory recall/store, Hack SAST receipt generation, repeated agentic eval proof, Terraform handoff checks, and a small FastAPI/React surface that exposes the workflow.",
    "does_not_prove": "OpenAI internal priorities, Azure deployment, full live Hack session-audit/scanning, Terraform apply, production readiness, or hand-coding performance as the primary claim."
  },
